title: "Predicting Ultrasound-Detected Gallstones from Non-Imaging Clinical Data: Cross-Cohort Generalization and Reference-Standard Validation"
abstract: >-
  An empirical investigation of machine learning generalization and target construct
  fidelity for non-imaging gallbladder stone risk prediction across hospital clinics,
  population health surveys, and direct physical ultrasonography.
